{"source":"github","project_id":"torchvisionlib","target":"mlverse/torchvisionlib","id":"pr/36","ref":36,"title":"Feat: Add `roi_align_rotated`","description":"Adds `ops_roi_align_rotated()` / `nn_roi_align_rotated()`, a CPU RoI align pooling op for rotated boxes, ported from mmcv (Apache-2.0). Includes dispatcher + autograd kernels, R API + docs, and tests. \r\n\r\nCloses #32 \r\n\r\n```r\r\nlibrary(torch)\r\nlibrary(torchvision)\r\nlibrary(torchvisionlib)\r\n\r\nurl \u003c- \"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b6/Felis_catus-cat_on_snow.jpg\"\r\narr \u003c- base_loader(url)                           \r\ninput \u003c- torch_tensor(arr)$permute(c(3, 1, 2))$unsqueeze(1)     \r\n\r\nrois \u003c- torch_tensor(matrix(c(\r\n  1, 3*W/2, 3*H/2, W, H, pi,\r\n  1, W/2,   3*H/2, W, H, pi,\r\n  1, 3*W/2, H/2, W, H, pi,\r\n  1, W/2,   H/2, W, H, pi\r\n), ncol = 6, byrow = TRUE), dtype = torch_float32())\r\n\r\nout \u003c- ops_roi_align_rotated(input, rois, c(128, 128), spatial_scale = 1, sampling_ratio = 2)\r\n\r\ngrid \u003c- vision_make_grid(out, num_rows = 2, padding = 6, pad_value = 1)\r\n\r\ntensor_image_browse(grid)     \r\n```\r\n\u003cimg width=\"274\" height=\"274\" alt=\"file339407cbfb\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a820f798-5bc9-4cf1-8a60-d505a665c620\" /\u003e\r\n","published_at":"2026-08-02T19:05:01Z","updated_at":"2026-09-01T11:30:12Z","url":"https://github.com/mlverse/torchvisionlib/pull/36","type":"pr","extra":{"author":"DerrickUnleashed","merged_at":"2026-09-01T11:30:12Z","state":"MERGED"}}
{"source":"github","project_id":"torchvisionlib","target":"mlverse/torchvisionlib","id":"pr/34","ref":34,"title":"Add box_iou_rotated","description":"Fix #31.\r\n\r\nAdds `ops_box_iou_rotated()`, computing IoU between rotated boxes on CPU, in the `cxcywhr`, `xywhr` and `xyxyxyxy` formats.","published_at":"2026-07-17T05:29:09Z","updated_at":"2026-08-17T22:20:47Z","url":"https://github.com/mlverse/torchvisionlib/pull/34","type":"pr","extra":{"author":"srishtiii28","merged_at":"2026-08-17T22:20:47Z","state":"MERGED"}}
{"source":"github","project_id":"torchvisionlib","target":"mlverse/torchvisionlib","id":"pr/33","ref":33,"title":"LW-DETR multi-scale deformable attention CUDA op","description":"Adds `ops_ms_deform_attn()`, the multi-scale deformable attention CUDA op LW-DETR needs (fix #25). Replaces the slow pure-R `grid_sample` fallback the decoder's cross-attention uses on GPU.","published_at":"2026-07-07T17:54:58Z","updated_at":"2026-08-01T10:41:36Z","url":"https://github.com/mlverse/torchvisionlib/pull/33","type":"pr","extra":{"author":"srishtiii28","merged_at":"2026-08-01T10:41:36Z","state":"MERGED"}}
